    sourceTitle: 'Freedom',
    tagline: 'What to read after Freedom by Jonathan Franzen',
    description: "Jonathan Franzen's Freedom (2010) is one of the defining American novels of the 2000s — Walter and Patty Berglund's marriage unraveling across three decades, the Iraq War in the background, the question of what freedom means when you have everything you wanted. If you were drawn to its emotional scale and its social ambition, these novels will find you in the same place.",
