    description: "The Odyssey defined the homecoming story — the long journey, the monsters, the loyal wife, the disguised return. Homer's epic is also a guide to cunning over strength, and to the idea that the journey shapes the traveler. These books share its adventure, its meditation on home and identity, and its engagement with myth.",
